1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,150
Fa ma raja'a, dia tidak pulang

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:03,240
semula ke rumah

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,010
sahabat Sa'd bin ar-Rabi' tadi,

4
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:08,840
hatta istafdala, hinggalah dia dapat

5
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:12,633
lebihan aqit wa samn.

6
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:17,530
Dia dapat dua barang makanan, satu

7
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:21,560
macam keju, satu macam minyak,

8
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,480
minyak sapi.

9
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,720
Dia pergi berniaga

10
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,640
dan dia dapat untung, dalam hadis

11
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:31,440
