19
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:51,710
Dua barang ni.

20
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:56,710
Dia balik tunjuk kat keluarga.

21
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:58,230
Hadis

22
00:01:01,490 --> 00:01:04,520
ini menunjukkan macam mana para

23
